<title>Myanmar's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/myanmar/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-myanmar-2026-11-08T19:49:46.929Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:49:46 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta bombed a health centre in Thailand's Tak province and struck Karen positions in Mae Hong Son, claiming resistance fire from Thailand, while resistance forces used drones to attack a Christian Bible school, killing three female students. An airstrike on a residence in Mrauk-U killed a pregnant woman and injured ten civilians, and the military is proceeding with April parliamentary by-elections in conflict-hit Sagaing, Chin and Shan, expanding voting to areas of ongoing fighting. The Tatmadow goodwill delegation returned from Laos and a Myanmar delegation participated in the HADR‑2026 disaster-relief exercise. Dead Starlink terminals are being repurposed to locate and kill people. The UCDP recorded 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168729&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE04M3ZtcFliR1ZfM3IxM2R3YWFsQ3ptd1BHRWJhMmJobWpnbUVVd2VOYkdfT2FLd2hDZjZpemoxYTZuTkp3eEhjNnVwaWg0eWNyWHRPaG80N3NRa0tDOFpfSDQ0cEF4dXlxclFRTDhhWWZxcFVtbDRvRzlHQ0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;E-International Relations&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Indiatimes&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxONTdUQXloNnBsM1hyMWlpZzJ1V1dqTEJER21jREVJRV81d19VWmtCbUZhYVdWT0NGRlFtMVI4TUJXUURZcWhVZ3dWcjB4M1lFeDVSWDNJRFdxN2tEQzY1M3gwMTJveW5xM1M5emdJLVo4dW9vRWJabElHSmlCc3ExUE5FRUhZNmVz?oc=5&quot;&gt;Myanmar International TV&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOU3NPRXg4LXQ0LW5RcG50ZmRFUzdVdW9sS0tQNU5Ba2g3b2NNRk1DcVRoMXVMYWV1MTFnYlphdTZBTFMwU29YanpBR3U2YTUyczlOaVl6TFRZRzVzSEdwMG5YVzVzMkdzTmo0ZUhZUmF